# Scratch for the panel extension study: downloaded structures, the 1,224
# generated pose files and the DockQ batch manifest. Regenerated deterministically
# from the frozen spec on every run, so it is never evidence and must never be
# committed. The study's own record lives in validation/panel-extension-v1/.
/.panel-extension-work/
/.dockq-src/
/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Exact derived census artifacts restored offline from the pinned gzip package.
/validation/hard-decoy-holdout-v3/global-text-discovery-2026-09-04/entries.jsonl
/validation/hard-decoy-holdout-v3/global-text-screen-2026-09-04/entity-screens.jsonl
